{"overview":"خانواده سابوری یک خانواده بزرگ و قدیمی است که سال‌هاست در زمینه صادرات و واردات گل و گیاه فعالیت می‌کند. آن‌ها هنوز در یک خانه قدیمی به آرامی زندگی می‌کنند؛ اما ورود یک جوان به این خانواده، زندگی تمام اعضا را دگرگون می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The Saburi family is a large and old family that has been exporting and importing flowers and plants for many years. They still live in peace in an old house, the arrival of a young man in this family changes the lives of the whole family.","tagline_en":"","runtime":50,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2020,"poster":"/3FYSTuS6RGZmKubSwl8JnHbc4Pr.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":12,"y":2020,"poster":"/2y6UcV2G8bwsV6kDdro7vz9UjGk.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":["Mostafa Kiaei"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["IR"],"cast":[{"name":"پرویز پرستویی","role":"Fariborz Sabouri","photo":"/5PsL8Y705hrHd9S97oWdA5bwWk3.jpg","en":"Parviz Parastouei"},{"name":"Hedie Tehrani","role":"Ziba Fakhri","photo":"/cx7GVl73szirtLiGZBBVk503jM2.jpg"},{"name":"محسن کیایی","role":"Arman Darbandi","photo":"/mHK0AyUoSvpsWu4YyvBCinPOGaP.jpg","en":"Mohsen Kiaei"},{"name":"Masoud Rayegan","role":"Farid Sabouri","photo":"/liuHKNFub4pLcspJUZw0pUeOd7i.jpg"},{"name":"مهدی پاکدل","role":"Farhad Sabouri","photo":"/puFWMbVKHkjC7UO0Is6Yu7DTaHK.jpg","en":"Mehdi Pakdel"},{"name":"Pedram Sharifi","role":"Peyman Sabouri","photo":"/9TTZGqfWBlOCZGO1QtAuiEf5mRb.jpg"},{"name":"Habib Rezaei","role":"Parviz Kouhi","photo":"/kXh90xn7i5hj5qfJWOErbPuOhlo.jpg"},{"name":"Hengame Ghaziani","role":"Leila Kouhi","photo":""},{"name":"Roya Teymourian","role":"Faride Sabouri","photo":"/eQXcd057ClTxzxXiMBLYWiF8KLD.jpg"},{"name":"افسانه چهره‌آزاد","role":"Nasrin","photo":"/aSyjcLLAyPCd5S5An5OiFe2XwXq.jpg","en":"Afsane Chehreazad"},{"name":"Shahrokh Foroutanian","role":"Iraj Darbandi","photo":"/mRTM0PMcQUT8tjUvytj4QeGymb4.jpg"},{"name":"افسانه ناصری","role":"Mojgan","photo":"/4T38MT000r8WFYcXHeYopLs1hPq.jpg","en":"Afsaneh Naseri"}],"trailer":"","watc